# Direct-dependency input for environment/requirements-lock-py312.txt.
#
# Every version below is the EXACT version installed in the Python 3.12.10
# environment that produced the paper outputs (the same pins recorded in
# environment.yml). Regenerate the hash lock with, from environment/:
#
#     pip-compile --generate-hashes --output-file requirements-lock-py312.txt \
#         lock-input-py312.in
#
# run inside a clean Python 3.12 virtual environment (pip install pip-tools).
# The scorch-heatwaves package itself is intentionally NOT listed (installed
# separately with `pip install --no-deps .`).

